  ('a3254474-5a15-4757-9c3a-7478429b2efc'::uuid, 'american-red-cross-central-midwest-georgia', 'American Red Cross chapter serving 21 Georgia counties, including Bibb, with offices in LaGrange, Macon and Warner Robins. Services include disaster relief and preparedness, blood-donation support, military-family assistance and lifesaving training. Holly Long is executive director, and David Gowan chairs the published FY 2027 board. The Macon office is at 6080 Lakeside Commons Drive, Suite B. Source: https://www.redcross.org/local/georgia/about-us/locations/central-midwest-georgia.html . Government reference: https://www.maconbibb.us/five-years-of-hope-brookdale-resource-center/ . Verified October 23, 2026.', 'Red Cross chapter providing disaster relief, preparedness, military-family support, and lifesaving training across Central Midwest Georgia.'),
