  ('76f79ff8-f360-465f-8be9-c37ee1a52da5'::uuid, 'american-red-cross-georgia-region', 'Regional structure coordinating Red Cross work across Georgia''s 159 counties. The official leadership roster lists Alicia Doherty as regional executive and five additional regional senior leaders. Source: https://www.redcross.org/local/georgia/about-us/leadership.html (verified October 23, 2026).', 'Regional organization coordinating Red Cross disaster relief, preparedness, and other humanitarian services across Georgia.'),
