  ('90078d47-bf0a-4113-bbfb-ede00fbbaeef'::uuid, 'community-foundation-of-central-georgia', 'Macon-based community foundation founded in 1993 to encourage philanthropy and strengthen Central Georgia communities. CFCG serves 21 counties, including Bibb, through charitable funds, nonprofit grants, scholarships, and community partnerships. It works with individuals, families, businesses, and nonprofit organizations to support local needs and long-term charitable goals. Kathryn H. Dennis leads the staff as president; Cynde M. Dickey chairs the 2026-27 board.

