  ('709fa82d-5606-4d59-bb34-f8277fd774c4'::uuid, 'knight-foundation', 'National philanthropic foundation supporting journalism, arts, information and society, and community impact. Macon is one of its 26 communities with historic Knight newspaper ties. Its Macon investments support locally led revitalization and civic life; a Knight grantee story documents $1.5 million in support for NewTown Macon''s work. The current staff directory lists Lynn Murphey as Director/Macon and Maribel Pérez Wadsworth as president and CEO.

