  ('c83589b4-6f17-4261-8466-1fc8467b4a12'::uuid, 'macon-outreach-at-mulberry', 'Community ministry begun at Mulberry Street United Methodist Church in 1971. It provides meals, emergency groceries and clothing to people experiencing poverty in Middle Georgia, with support from congregations, volunteers and local partners. Georgia''s Department of Community Supervision lists it as a Bibb County reentry resource. Sources: https://www.mulberrymethodist.org/missions ; https://dcs.georgia.gov/locations/macon-outreach . Verified October 23, 2026. The ministry''s own domain had a certificate/fetch problem during verification; supporting church and government sources were used.', 'Mulberry Street United Methodist Church ministry providing meals, groceries, and clothing to people experiencing poverty in Middle Georgia.'),
  ('07d79079-9a9e-4110-8e32-e0093168c480'::uuid, 'macon-periods-easier', 'Nonprofit addressing period poverty and menstrual-health education; county government identifies it as a Brookdale supporter and a partner in making period products available in county restrooms.

