Government reference (verified October 23, 2026): https://www.maconbibb.us/community-foundation-of-central-georgia-awards-more-than-350000-in-grants-to-21-nonprofits/', 'Macon disability-services and advocacy nonprofit supporting people with intellectual and developmental disabilities and their families.'),
  ('e131019f-badc-473f-bde8-a85715431fa6'::uuid, 'the-mentors-project-of-bibb-county', 'Youth mentoring organization listed among county community-development partners and Brookdale Resource Center supporters.

